{"Time? Raith asked.\n“\003Eleven-thirty-nine\004, my lord,” the bodyguard reported.\n“Ah, good. Still time.” He walked over to a group of pillows in the far corner of the room, and I realized that they had been strewn around a little raised platform of stone.","Blood Rites","Jim Butcher",true},
{"There’s a whisper down the line at \00311:39\004\nWhen the Night Mail’s ready to depart, Saying “Skimble where is Skimble has he gone to hunt the thimble? We must find him or the train can’t start.”","Old Possum’s Book of Practical Cats","T.S. Eliot",true},
},
["23:40"]={
{"It was about \003twenty minutes to twelve\004. It was then I heard the lift. It’s opposite Sister’s suite — well, I expect you’ve seen it. I just heard the gentle clang of the doors and then a sort of purring sound as it went down.","The Private Patient","P.D. James",true},
{"Grant noticed the time. “It’s \00320 minutes until midnight\004. Who wants to help me hand out glasses and pour champagne?”","Warrior Monk","Ray Keating",true},
{"I went to the kitchen to select another bottle, deciding to reduce the next day’s alcohol intake to compensate. Then I saw the clock: \00311:40 pm\004. I picked up the phone and ordered a taxi. With any luck it would arrive before the after-midnight tariff commenced.","The Rosie Project","Graeme Simsion",true},
