["23:50"]={
{"The clock on the wall read \003ten to midnight\004. Cork wanted to turn the hands back, do it all differently, be in all the right places at all the right times. He wanted a second chance at the last few days. The last few years.","Purgatory Ridge","William Kent Krueger",true},
